    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147870/extras/a7bfee1ead0dd5a3aecb3f96285fd15c.avif?t=1725553818\" width=640 height=120 /></span><br><br><u>The main genre is &quot;Horror&quot;, &quot;Walking Simulator&quot;.</u><br><br><strong>Description: </strong><br>One evening, you were sent a box with photographs of a mysterious place and a letter in which it was said that an artifact of an ancient civilization was hidden in this place...<br><br>Do you dare to go in search of this ancient artifact?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147870/extras/6529dd4f224c5450f4ba5ae4226e37bd.poster.avif?t=1725553818\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147870/extras/6529dd4f224c5450f4ba5ae4226e37bd.webm?t=1725553818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147870/extras/6529dd4f224c5450f4ba5ae4226e37bd.mp4?t=1725553818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Peculiarities:</strong><br><u>VHS Effect.</u><br><u>Realistic graphics.</u><br><u>Frighteningly natural sound design.</u><br><br><i>Approximate game duration: 30 - 60 minutes.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147870/extras/e914a22025e7a32af487917aad7c8de7.poster.avif?t=1725553818\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147870/extras/e914a22025e7a32af487917aad7c8de7.webm?t=1725553818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147870/extras/e914a22025e7a32af487917aa